        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The light has faded, and the world has sunk into silence and darkness.<br>Only one beacon rises above the endless expanse, and only you can ignite its light.<br>To awaken the beacon, you must journey through gloomy locations and collect the stars scattered across the world.<br>Each one is a fragment of the lost light, and only by gathering them all will you be able to dispel the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luminaria</strong> is a meditative journey where the focus is not on speed but on atmosphere.<br>The world responds to your presence, and your path is filled with soft radiance that step by step brings back hope.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sole grand goal</strong> — collect all the stars to activate the main beacon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric world</strong> — a blend of darkness and light in a minimalist visual style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meditative gameplay</strong> — no battles or timers, just you and a peaceful adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth animation and light effects</strong> — creating the feeling of a living world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Musical accompaniment</strong> — a gentle soundtrack that enhances the atmosphere of the journey.</p></li></ul>",
